ISO-10303-21;
/* Gs064: TOROIDAL_SURFACE (R=10.0, r=10.0) IS inside GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET; R == r (inner equator collapses: self-intersecting torus) IS the defect; IsVClosed midpoint sampling returns false negative on near-degenerate torus IS the mechanism failure; shape_null */
